Known issues:
	Waveform.fNameOfWaveform is not filled

ChangeLog:
	Full changelog available with 'git log'

2022-07-22 Vladimir Belov <belov@itep.ru>
	Release version 0.2
	Change build system to CMake
	Automatically generate build configuration
	Move major part of the code to distinct libraries and modules
	Add command-line arguments
	Begin documentation project
	Introduce configuration file with processing parameters
	Make some parameters per-channel based
	Print modules configuration before processing
	Introduce module factory to handle modules registry
	Add support for multiple runs in a single file
	Add support for ZeplinIII data files
	Add support for COHERENT CsI data files
	Add support for COHERENT CENNS-10 data files
	Introduce specific clustering for each data type
	Add module to correct waveforms for baseline overshoot
	Add module to correct waveforms for low frequency pileup
	Improve pulse finding algorythm
	Switch to using TTimestamp for time stamps
	Improve File class to read/write events as objects
	Move to wider use of TRefs inside event
	Improve Inspector module
	Adapt code to use with ROOT6 and modern compilers
	Fix many bugs

2013-11-20 Vladimir Belov <belov@itep.ru>
	Release version 0.1
	Main event class Event created
	Main interface for processing modules created
	Created class File for read/write of events (legacy mode only)
	Initial trivial implementation of PulseFinder module
	Added Inspector module to show plots
	Initial trivial implemetation of ClusteringModule
